Bright moonlight before my bed;
I suppose it is frost on the ground.
A small boat drifts on the river of time, passing through the heavenly gates and the war drums of Yuyang. You witnessed the ever-lit Chang'an turn into scorched earth in an instant, leaving only desolation echoing in the winds of history.

To join the Midnight Blades is to bear the world's sins in blood;
To walk the path of killing is to kill so others need not.
Outside, offer deliverance to those in suffering;
Within, help your brethren find relief from karmic pain.
